    "title": "WORKFLOW_Sandbox_Hotel Room Availability API",
    "description": "The Hotel Room Availability API allows users to check the availability of rooms in various hotels for specified dates. This API is essential for travel agencies, booking platforms, and end-users planning their trips. By submitting date ranges and hotel identifiers, consumers can receive real-time availability information. This functionality enhances the user experience by facilitating informed decision-making when selecting lodging options.",
